      ],
      "text": "The README describes Kimi CLI as a terminal AI agent that helps complete software development tasks and terminal operations: it reads and edits code, executes shell commands, searches and fetches web pages, and autonomously plans and adjusts actions during execution."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2de7cbb8e74f3dfc5559ed151ee9a01149bc2bf99c6e6455bf0f64cb702afa66",
